      "content": "I'd suggest framing the audit results as a \"clean bill of health\" with only minor, easily addressable issues that are already being proactively managed by their current security team. Emphasize that these minor gaps can be quickly plugged with the Advanced Continuous Monitoring package, which will provide them with the added layer of protection and peace of mind they need to stay ahead of potential threats. By highlighting the proactive measures they're already taking, we can position the upgrade as a natural next step in their security evolution, rather than a reactive response to the audit findings. This will help them see the value in upgrading to the premium tier and meeting our expansion targets.",
